354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eq_TFu9UzzMQ7kNvwFgerg6&_nc_oc=AdpwTG7nhiY9bcfwZMl14mhkiQC_fPSiK2eqCAtDpCn5TzNAtsQhShKycw7WVYL_knk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRtwpSp-EON1O2Xrx5OUG3V_CwHbEU-mhRXAIpi3IMb8Q&oe=6B01D2E3"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zy2vYwMewp4Q7kNvwFhWxIa&_nc_oc=Ado3iS9VLeOT7QpHwsUqWhXq0gAYe2FHd1oPwYnu0q7dJQmzmp0Y5PTO9MvBpFfGvOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSz1ZSpRYC6VTz9qUVukREuWDelQFBO7iZe-wDrEjU5sw&oe=6B01D1F0"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vtzs2GNwi3UQ7kNvwE1qRbx&_nc_oc=AdpVXgEM-Ry6eQZGAgf-lqU0hMnVEEm7Hk3vYJhDYTvSToMzCwMDEHsUOaVXEzxnBTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_SYyMF84nOxS1rhgAxTtwvIo1u-hR5zpw4Qyt9qqIvw&oe=6B01D0AD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur